[{"id":1884,"date":"2023-12-24T01:41:04","date_gmt":"2023-12-24T01:41:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/?post_type=cp_recipe&#038;p=1884"},"modified":"2023-12-24T01:41:04","modified_gmt":"2023-12-24T01:41:04","slug":"chocolate-peanut-butter-protein-bowl","status":"publish","type":"cp_recipe","link":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/recipes\/chocolate-peanut-butter-protein-bowl\/","title":{"rendered":"Chocolate Peanut Butter Protein Bowl"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>This recipe is a tasty way to start your day with over 30 grams of protein. Starting your day with adequate protein is an important factor for managing your blood sugar and overall hormone health. This doesn\u2019t require any extra dishes or heating to prepare, so its a yummy, efficient way to have a nice meal before starting your day. <\/h2>\n<h3>Ingredients<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-ingredients\">\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Organic Peanut Butter (Creamy or Crunchy, as you prefer)<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\"><\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Scoop of Sakara Life Metabolism Super Powder (sub raw organic cacao powder)<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"2\">2<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Kroma Wellness Cacao Banana Protein powder<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Fage Greek yogurt (sub with preferred yogurt or plant based yogurt)<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Ground\/milled flax seed<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\"><\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Drizzle of honey, as you prefer<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Chopped medjool date<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3>Directions<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-directions\">\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 1\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>In a bowl, add 1 cup of yogurt. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 2\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Add dry ingredients (Protein powder, milled flax seed and Metabolism powder) to yogurt and mix. Incorporate thoroughly to avoid clumps. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 3\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Place a dollop of peanut butter on top of mixture.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 4\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Drizzle with honey or chopped medjool dates to taste.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 5\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Additional notes: <\/p>\n<p>Add more yogurt if you like a creamier consistency. <\/p>\n<p>Plant based yogurts tend to have less protein than dairy yogurts so check your nutritional information to get an accurate sense of total grams of protein. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1889,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","recipe_category":[178],"class_list":["post-1884","cp_recipe","type-cp_recipe","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","cp_recipe_category-breakfast-recipes"],"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1884","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/cp_recipe"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1884"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1884\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1889"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1884"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"cp_recipe_category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/recipe_category?post=1884"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":1492,"date":"2021-11-05T20:17:59","date_gmt":"2021-11-05T20:17:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/?post_type=cp_recipe&#038;p=1492"},"modified":"2021-11-05T20:18:00","modified_gmt":"2021-11-05T20:18:00","slug":"fall-inspired-overnight-oats","status":"publish","type":"cp_recipe","link":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/recipes\/fall-inspired-overnight-oats\/","title":{"rendered":"Fall-Inspired Overnight Oats"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Fall-Inspired Overnight Oats<\/h2>\n<h3>Ingredients<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-ingredients\">\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Organic Steel Cut Oats<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Organic plant based milk <\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Hemp hearts<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Chia seeds<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Organic Almond butter or peanut butter<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.5\">&#189;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Finely chopped organic apple<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Lemon juice<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.5\">&#189;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Ground cinnamon<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Ground nutmeg <\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Maple syrup<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Vanilla extract<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">Chopped pecans or walnuts<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3>Directions<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-directions\">\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 1\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Roughly chop nuts and set aside. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 2\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Finely chop apples and place in a bowl. Cover with lemon juice and stir. Add cinnamon and nutmeg. Set aside. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 3\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Add dry ingredients (oats, chia seeds, hemp hearts, chopped nuts) to container.  Top with milk alternative and vanilla. Shake well. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 4\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Add almond\/peanut butter and top with apple mixture. Seal container and allow oats and chia to absorb milk alternative. Enjoy! <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1494,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","recipe_category":[],"class_list":["post-1492","cp_recipe","type-cp_recipe","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1492","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/cp_recipe"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1492"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1492\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1494"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1492"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"cp_recipe_category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/recipe_category?post=1492"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":1164,"date":"2021-03-15T04:27:37","date_gmt":"2021-03-15T04:27:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/?post_type=cp_recipe&#038;p=1164"},"modified":"2021-03-15T04:40:27","modified_gmt":"2021-03-15T04:40:27","slug":"springtime-orzo-salad","status":"publish","type":"cp_recipe","link":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/recipes\/springtime-orzo-salad\/","title":{"rendered":"Springtime Orzo Salad"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Springtime Orzo Salad<\/h2>\n<h3>Ingredients<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-ingredients\">\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1.5\">1.50<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cups<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">dry orzo pasta<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.5\">&#189;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped tomato<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.5\">&#189;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped cucumber<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1\">1<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped sundried tomato<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped dill<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped kalamata olives<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">cherry tomatos, halved<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped bell pepper (or jalapeno if you like it spicy \ud83d\ude42<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.25\">&#188;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">chopped red onion<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"0.5\">&#189;<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">cup<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">garbanzo beans<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"2.5\">2.50<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">olive oil<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-amount\" data-decimal=\"1.5\">1.50<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-measurement\">tbsp<\/span> <span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">red wine vinegar<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">fresh lemon<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">freshly ground pepper<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">himalayan salt<\/span><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"recipeIngredient\" class=\"cooked-single-ingredient cooked-ingredient cooked-ing-no-checkbox\"><span class=\"cooked-ing-name\">optional: vegan feta or sheep&#8217;s milk feta<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3>Directions<\/h3>\n<div class=\"cooked-recipe-directions\">\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 1\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Boil orzo according to cooking instructions on the box. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 2\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>While pasta is cooking, finely chop cucumber, green pepper, tomato, dill, onion, cherry tomatoes, sun dried tomatoes and kalamata olives. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 3\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>When pasta is done cooking, drain but do not rinse. Place pasta and chopped ingredients into a mixing bowl. Keep approx. 1 tsp of the dill to one side to add as garnish. Add garbanzo beans, olive oil, red wine vinegar and a squeeze of fresh lemon juice. Add fresh ground pepper and salt to taste. Mix well.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"cooked-single-direction cooked-direction\" data-step=\"Step 4\">\n<div class=\"cooked-dir-content\">\n<p>Plate and top with remaining dill. Optional: add vegan or sheep&#8217;s milk feta cheese. Pro tip: salad will taste even better after being refrigerated for a few hours. <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1169,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","recipe_category":[116],"class_list":["post-1164","cp_recipe","type-cp_recipe","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","cp_recipe_category-dinner-recipes"],"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1164","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/cp_recipe"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1164"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cooked_recipe\/1164\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1169"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1164"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"cp_recipe_category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/recipe_category?post=1164"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":975,"date":"2021-01-22T04:38:08","date_gmt":"2021-01-22T04:38:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/laviedezee.com\/?post_type=cp_recipe&#038;p=975"},"modified":"2021-02-14T03:17:05","modified_gmt":"2021-02-14T03:17:05","slug":"the-green-juice-goddess","status":"